#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:4
msgid "AI Notetakers That Don't Join Your Call as a Bot (2026)"
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:5
msgid ""
"No more 'X has joined the meeting.' The tools that capture meetings "
"without a visible bot — how bot-free capture works, and the honest trade-"
"offs of each option."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:6 site/content/links.py:1
msgid "AI notetakers that don't join your call as a bot"
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:7
msgid ""
"Disclosure: I make MeetMouse, one of the tools below. I'll be straight "
"about the others."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:8
#: site/articles/blog__do-ai-notetakers-record-your-calls.html:8
#: site/articles/blog__fathom-pricing.html:8
#: site/articles/blog__granola-pricing.html:8
#: site/articles/blog__otter-pricing.html:8
#: site/articles/blog__private-ai-meeting-notes.html:8 site/build.py:763
#: site/build.py:943
msgid "Quick answer"
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:9
msgid ""
"Only a few tools do this. <strong>Granola</strong> is the best bot-free "
"<em>notetaker</em> (notes via cloud AI). <strong>Poised</strong> is bot-"
"free but cloud-processed coaching. <a "
"href=\"/\"><strong>MeetMouse</strong></a> is bot-free <em>and</em> fully "
"on-device — nothing leaves your Mac. The DIY option (record locally, "
"paste into AI) also works if you're patient."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:11
msgid ""
"You know the moment. The call connects, and then: <em>\"Fireflies.ai "
"Notetaker has joined the meeting.\"</em> Your candidate stiffens. Your "
"prospect asks what it is. Your report gets a little more careful. "
"Whatever the tool captures after that is a slightly worse conversation "
"than the one you would have had."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:14
msgid "Which AI notetakers don't use a bot?"
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:14
msgid ""
"Granola (notes via cloud AI), Poised (cloud coaching), and MeetMouse "
"(fully on-device coaching) all capture system audio on your computer "
"instead of joining the call. Fireflies and tl;dv send a visible bot. "
"Otter and Fathom do by default, though Otter's desktop app can record "
"without a bot and Fathom lists bot-free capture as a beta."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:15
msgid "How do no-bot meeting tools capture the audio?"
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:15
msgid ""
"They record system audio — the sound your computer is already playing — "
"plus your microphone, locally on your machine. Nothing joins the meeting,"
" so participants see nothing."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:16
msgid "Is it legal to use a notetaker that doesn't announce itself?"
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:16
msgid ""
"Bot or no bot, recording-consent laws still apply to you. Many teams "
"disclose verbally regardless of tool. For regulated or two-party-consent "
"situations, ask counsel — the bot avatar was never the legally relevant "
"part."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:17
msgid "What's the most private no-bot option?"
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/blog__ai-notetaker-without-bot.html:17
msgid ""
"MeetMouse — it's the only one where audio is also processed entirely on-"
"device rather than sent to cloud AI. It works with WiFi off; nothing is "
"uploaded, ever."
msgstr ""

