#: site/articles/compare__meetmouse-vs-poised.html:40
msgid "Yes — post-meeting reports and trends"
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__meetmouse-vs-poised.html:40
msgid "Session dashboards on your Mac; no cloud history"
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__meetmouse-vs-poised.html:41
