msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:55
msgid ""
"This is where most people start, so it's worth being precise. Otter's "
"free plan is 300 minutes a month, which is about five one-hour meetings. "
"Except it isn't, because each conversation stops at 30 minutes. If your "
