msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:56
msgid ""
"Fireflies' free plan transcribes without a monthly minute cap, which "
"sounds better, but storage is 400 minutes for the whole team and AI "
"summaries are limited. You'll hit the storage wall in a week or two of "
"real use."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:57
msgid ""
"My take: neither free plan is meant to be lived on. If free is the "
"requirement, Fathom's free plan is more generous than both."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:65
msgid ""
"<strong>Search.</strong> If the job is \"find what was said three months "
"ago,\" Otter does it with less setup and less cost."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:66
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<strong>One person.</strong> Otter Pro at {annual_price} a month billed "
"annually is the cheapest serious plan here. Fireflies is really a per-"
"seat team decision."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:67
msgid ""
"<strong>Simplicity.</strong> Fewer knobs. You don't need an admin to get "
"value out of it."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:76
msgid ""
"<strong>The pipeline.</strong> Automatic CRM logging, deal context and "
"scorecards. If you manage revenue, this is the machine."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:77
msgid ""
"<strong>Team analytics.</strong> Talk time, topics and trends across "
"every rep's calls, in one place."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:78
msgid ""
"<strong>No monthly minute meter on transcription.</strong> Otter counts "
"minutes on every plan below Business; Fireflies meters storage instead."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:85
msgid "My verdict"
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:86
msgid ""
"If you're one person, pick Otter. If you run a sales team and live in the"
" CRM, pick Fireflies. If you're one person and you're looking at "
"Fireflies, you're probably buying a truck to go get groceries."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:87
msgid ""
"And if you haven't tried the free stuff yet: try Fathom's free plan "
"first. It might be all you need."
msgstr ""

#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:94
msgid ""
"Both put a bot in the room and your conversations in a company's cloud. "
"With Fireflies, your calls are also reviewable by whoever runs the "
"dashboard. That's great for pipeline hygiene and less great for how it "
"feels to be on either side of the call."
