#: site/articles/compare__otter-vs-fireflies.html:95
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If what you actually want is to get <em>better</em> on calls, privately, "
"with no bot and nothing leaving your laptop, that's what I built <a "
"href=\"/\">MeetMouse</a> for: notes and next steps on your Mac, plus live"
